# Kconfig for the Hello sample library.

config HELLO
  bool "Enable Hello Swift Sample Module"
  help
    Build the Hello sample library, which an application imports with
    `import Hello`. It provides hello(timeout:) and Hello.run(timeout:), which
    print a greeting and then `still running...` at a fixed interval and never
    return.

    Requires CONFIG_SWIFT=y. Disable it to leave the library out of the build.
